683	           * riscv/interrupt.c) instead of g_handle_map.  Call that
684	           * handler directly -- its ISR clears the level source, so
685	           * skipping it would leave the line asserted forever and
686	           * re-trigger this dispatch (level-triggered storm).
687	           */
