219	    // Note: DO NOT clear the interrupt status bits here. The output routine needs
220	    // USB_SERIAL_JTAG_INTR_SERIAL_IN_EMPTY set because it needs the ISR to trigger
221	    // as soon as data is sent; the input routine needs the status to retrieve any
222	    // data that is still in the FIFOs.
